<br>Nikla wo sher khaime ke baahar alam liye <br>
Mujre ko aayi fat'he sipaah-e-hasham liye <br>
Jurrat ne badh ke bosa-e-tegh-e-do dum liye <br>
Nusrat ne choome paao, zafar ne qadam liye <br>
<br>
<br>
Khursheed ka jalaal nigaaho'n se gir gayaa <br>
Iqbaal sar ke gird humaa ban ke phir gaya<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Aaya sajaa hua wo samand-e-Buraaq Sair <br>
Tha jo falak pe udne ko taiyaar misl-e-tair <br>
Hota tha uske dar se ghazaalon ka haal ghair <br>
In me sipaah-e-shar use roke, to ye bakhair <br>
<br>
<br>
Sar sar qadam ki gard ko paati nahi kabhi <br>
Dhoonde basher, pari nazar aati nahi kabhi<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Wo zaib o zain zeen ki wo saaz wo phaban <br>
Zevar me jaise hoti hai aaraasta dulhan <br>
Chashm-e-siyaah deeda-e-aahu pe taanazan <br>
Sar'at ye thi ke bhoolte the chaukdi hiran <br>
<br>
<br>
Jaadu tha maujiza tha pari thi tilism tha <br>
Paakhur na thi zira me tehemtan ka jism tha<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Rakkha qadam rakaab me Haider ke laal ne <br>
Nalain-e-paa ko fakhr se chooma hilaal ne <br>
Bakhshi jo sadr-e-zee'n ko zia, Khush Khisaal ne <br>
Dum ko chawar kiya faras-e-bemisaal ne <br>
<br>
<br>
Kis naaz se wo rashk-e-ghazaal-e-khutan chala <br>
Taoos tha ke sair ko soo-e-chaman chala<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Khushboo se arz-e-paak riyaaz-e-jinaa'n bani <br>
Gard udh ke ghaaza-e-rukh-e-laila wishaa'n bani <br>
Jalwe se raah-e-dasht-e-bala kehkasha'n bani <br>
Zarre bane nujoom, zamee aasmaa'n bani <br>
<br>
<br>
Sum burd the to naal bhi chaaro hilaal the<br>
Naqsh-e-sum-e-faras se hazaaro hilaal the<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Wo dabdaba wo satwat-e-shahana wo shabaab <br>
Tharraa raha tha jiski jalalat se aaftaab<br>
Wo raub-e-Haq ke sher ka zohra ho aab aab <br>
Saulat me fard, Daftar-e-Jurrat mein intekhaab <br>
<br>
<br>
Tevar me saare taur Khuda ke Vali ke hai<br>
Shaukat pukaarti hai ke bete Ali ke hai<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Pohanche jo dasht-e-kee'n me udhate huwe faras <br>
Ghode ko haath uttha ke ye aawaaz di ke bas <br>
Dekhe safe jami jo chap o raas o pesh o pas <br>
Naara kiya ke neher pe jaane ki hai hawas <br>
<br>
<br>
Rokega jo wo maut ke panje me aayega <br>
Hat jaao sab ke sher taraai me jaayega<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Roke hume nikal ke jo taaqat kisi me ho <br>
Le tegh miyaan se jo shajaa'at kisi me ho <br>
Garmaaye rakhsh ko jo haraarat kisi me ho <br>
Aaye jo harb o zarb ki qudrat kisi me ho <br>
<br>
<br>
Do haath mein Ali ke pisar waar paar hai <br>
Darya nahi jo ruk gaya, hum Zulfiqaar hai<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Tum kya pahaad beech me gar ho to taal de'n<br>
Shero'n ko hum taraai se baahar nikaal de'n <br>
Mohlat na ek ko dam-e-jung o jadaal de'n<br>
Paani to kya hai, Aag mein ghode ko daal de'n<br>
<br>
<br>
Muh dekhte hai jo hai nigehbaan ghaat ke <br>
Le jaayei'n ghar pe tegh se darya ko kaat ke<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Sarkash hai sab hamaari zabardastiyo'n se zer <br>
Dada shuja hai, baap Ululazm, hum diler <br>
Jab ran pada hai kar diye hai zakhmiyo'n ke dher <br>
Laaye the jaake aag se paani Khuda ke sher <br>
<br>
<br>
Afreet bhaagte hain wo chotei'n hamaari hai<br>
Beerul Alam me kood ke talwaarei'n maari hai<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Jurrat jilo me rehti hai nusrat rakaab me <br>
Lete hai ghaat pair ke teghou ki aab me<br>
Likkhe huwe hai shero ke hamle kitaab me <br>
Faslei'n hain apne zor ki khaiber ke baab mein <br>
<br>
<br>
Naasir hain Baadshah-e-Falak-Baargaah ke <br>
Daftar ulat diye hain Arab ki sipaah ke<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Be mashq ke bhare hume aata hai chain kab <br>
Garmi me pyaas se kayi bachche hai jaa'n balab <br>
Asghar ki godiyou me tadapte kati hai shab <br>
Kya waqt hai Hussain ke bachchou pe hai ghazab <br>
<br>
<br>
Laale pade hue ha Sakeena ki jaan ke <br>
Kaante mujhe dikhaaye the sookhi zabaan ke<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Ibrat ki ye jagaa hai ke hum aur sawaal-e-aab <br>
Saqqaa bane hain dekh ke bachcho ka iztaraab <br>
Is mashq ne kiya hume uqba me kaamyaab <br>
Allah ri aabroo ke behishti mila khitaab <br>
<br>
<br>
Sheh se nishaan-e-fauj-e-payambar bhi mil gaya <br>
Toobaa ke saath chashma-e-Kausar bhi mil gaya<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Ye zikr tha ke fauj ki jaanib se teer aaye <br>
Naize uttha ke sher ke moo par shareer aaye <br>
Ye bhi jhapat ke misl-e-Shah-e-Qillageer aaye <br>
Geti hili ghazab me Janaab-e-Ameer aaye <br>
<br>
<br>
Ghoda udha parou ko sawaaron ke tod ke <br>
Lapti safou pe saif bhi kathi ko chhod ke<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Toda ye morcha, ye saf ulti, udhar phire <br>
Talwaar khoo'n me, aap paseene me tar phire <br>
Yu khaak pe gira ke laeenou ke sar phire <br>
Jaise shikaar khele hue sher-e-nar phire <br>
<br>
<br>
Thi qehar ki nigaah, ghazab ka Jamaal tha <br>
Aankhe bhi surkh surkh thi, chehra bhi laal tha<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Beshak tha inka haath Ameer-e-Arab ka haath <br>
Pohncha wighaa me sau taraf ek tashnalab ka haath <br>
Aayi ajal uttha jo kisi be adab ka haath <br>
Sher-e-Khuda ke sher ne maara ghazab ka haath <br>
<br>
<br>
Aise jari se kisko majaal-e-masaaf thi <br>
Yu phir ke saf ki saf ko jo dekha to saaf thi<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Chalta tha misl-e-barq yameen o yasaar haath <br>
Dar dar ke jodte the zalaalat shiyaar haath <br>
Inki na ek zarb na unke hazaar haath <br>
Kaafi the sab ko tegh-e-do dasti ke chaar haath <br>
<br>
<br>
Aawaaz shashjahat me bageedo bazan ki thi <br>
Allah ka karam tha madad Panjetan ki thi<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Badh badh ke kaat ti thi wo talwaar haath paao<br>
Dar se badha na sakte the khoo'nkhaar haath paavo<br>
Sar bach gaya to ho gaye bekaar haath paao<br>
Chamki wo yu ke aanth hue chaar haath paao<br>
<br>
<br>
Roohei'n pukaarei'n sher phir aaya nikal chalo <br>
Boli ajal, ab uth ke to panjou ke bal chalo<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Pehne huwe the jism pe zirhei'n jo chust chust <br>
Chotei'n kadi padei'n to huwe sab wo sakht sust <br>
Khauf-e-ajal se bhool gaye waada-e-nakhust <br>
Tooti safou me haath kisi ke na the durust <br>
<br>
<br>
Ek shor tha ke jaan gayi is ladaai me<br>
Ghode bhagaao, aag lagi hai taraai me<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Maghfar na sar ke paas na khanjar kamar ke paas <br>
Bete ke paas baap na beta pidar ke paas <br>
Qabze ke paas tegh na dasta tabar ke paas <br>
Kadiyaa'n zirha ke paas na daaman sipar ke paas <br>
<br>
<br>
Abvi sinaan par thi na parcham nishaan par <br>
Paikaa'n na teer par the na chille kamaan par<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Allah re jung-e-sher-e-nayastaan-e-Karbala <br>
Chooti bhi morcho mein na thi aadmi to kya<br>
Pohnche taraai me to ye aada ko di sada <br>
Kyon Ab ye neher kiski hai, aye qaum-e-ashqiya <br>
<br>
<br>
Ek aan me shikast hazaarou ko dete hai <br>
Dekho asad taraai ko youn chheen lete hai<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Raste khule huwe hai kahaa hai wo bandobast<br>
Kisne ye rom o shaam ki faujou ko di shikast<br>
Kya ho gaye taraai se wo sab hawa parast <br>
Kyo sar baland kaun hai is waqt, kaun past<br>
<br>
<br>
Faujou me yu kisi ne bhi ghode udhaayei'n hain <br>
Dekho to hum kahaa se kahaa ladte aaye hai<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Dunya bhi ek taraf ho to hum pe zafar na paaye <br>
Faaqou me sher bhi ho muqabil to muh ki khaaye <br>
Kis dabdabe se jauhar-e-jung-e-Ali dikhaaye <br>
Ab kuch alam nahi, ajal aaye ke jaan jaaye <br>
<br>
<br>
Bas hum ne ghaat chheen liya, mashk bhar chuke <br>
Shero ne jo zabaa se kaha tha wo kar chuke<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Lab tashna teen din se hai aur hai furaat paas <br>
Chaahei'n abhi to haath badha kar buhaayei'n pyaas <br>
Par zeher hai baghair Shah-e-Aasmaa Asaas <br>
Marte hai aabru pe Ghulamaan-e-Haq Shanaas <br>
<br>
<br>
Aaqa ki tashnagi pe jigar chaak chaak hai <br>
Be inke aab-e-Khizr bhi howe to khaak hai<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Farma ke ye samand ko daala furaat me<br>
Goya-e-Khizr utar gaye aab-e-hayaat me<br>
Daryadil aisa kaun hua Kayenaat me<br>
Tasma pakad ke mashk bhari ek baat me<br>
<br>
<br>
Seraab jab talak ke Shah-e-Behr o Bar na ho'n <br>
Manzoor hai ke haath bhi paani se tar na ho'n<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Darya se mashk bhar ke jo nikla wo nekh naam <br>
Umdi siyaah ghata ki tarha sab sipaah-e-Shaam <br>
Yu doob ke nikalta tha wo Aasmaa'n Maqaam <br>
Zaahir ho jaise abr me chhup kar Mah-e-Tamaam <br>
<br>
<br>
Maujei'n thi rood-e-Neel ki, faujo'n ka dal na tha <br>
Par waah ri hawaas ke abru pe bal na tha<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Ghere the ek jaan ko do laakh ahl-e-shar <br>
Tehre kahaa'n, qaraar kaha'n le, thame kidhar <br>
Chhati ke paas barchhiyaa'n, teghe qareeb-e-sar <br>
Pehlu me is taraf to sinaanei'n, udhar tabar <br>
<br>
<br>
Milti na thi amaa sipah-e-teera bakht se <br>
Gosho'n se teer chalte the patthar darakht se<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Jab mashk ki taraf koi aata tha san se teer <br>
Kehte the Ya Hafeez kabhi gaah Ya Qadeer <br>
Chilla raha tha Shimr-e-jafa pesha o shareer <br>
Jaane na paaye Lakhte Dil-e-Shaah-e-Qillageer<br>
<br>
<br>
Rukh is jari ka khaime ki jaanib se modh do <br>
Haa'n barchhiyo'n se sher ke seene ko todh do<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Sun kar zabaa'n daraazi-e-Shimr-e-sitam shiyaar <br>
Abbas misl-e-sher jhapat'te the baar baar <br>
Talwaare sainkdo thi, hazaaro'n the naizadaar <br>
Todi agar ye saf to jami doosri qataar <br>
<br>
<br>
Tanha sambhaale mashk o alam ya wigha kare <br>
Balwa ho puri fauj ka jis par wo kya kare<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Mash'hoor hai ke ek pe bhaari hai do bashar <br>
Dar pe the ek jawaa'n ke liye laakh ahl-e-shar <br>
Khaaye idhar se zakhm jo ki us taraf nazar <br>
Kis kis ka waar rad kare dekhe'n kidhar kidhar <br>
<br>
<br>
Jab dum liya to seene pe sau teer chal gaye <br>
Pehlu ko tod tod ke naize nikal gaye<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Seena sipar the mashk pe roke huwe the dhaal <br>
Ladne me bhi Hussain ke bachchou'n ka tha khayaal <br>
Kehta tha dagmaga ke faras par wo Khush Khisaal <br>
Farzand ko sambhaaliye, Ya Sher-e-Zuljalaal <br>
<br>
<br>
Jaa pohanchu mashk le ke jo thodi si raah ho <br>
Aisa na ho ke pyaasou ki basti tabaah ho<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Ye kehte the ke toot pada lashkar-e-shareer <br>
Bas chur ho gaya pisar-e-Shaah-e-Qillageer <br>
Aakar laga miyaan-e-do abroo pe ek teer <br>
Tiora gaya Ali-e-Wali ka Mah-e-Muneer <br>
<br>
<br>
Chhodhi jo bag paao faras ke bhi ruk gaye <br>
Phaila ke haath mashk-e-Sakina pe jhuk gaye<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Sheh daud kar pukaare ke aata hu Bhai Jaan <br>
Ghar lut gaya hai khaak udata hu Bhai Jaan <br>
Taaqat badan me ab nahi paata hu Bhai Jaan <br>
Ek ek qadam pe thokarei'n khata hu Bhai Jaan <br>
<br>
<br>
Dast-e-shikasta bete ki gardan mein dale hai <br>
Bhaiyya hume to Akbar-e-Mehru sambhaale hai<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Akbar ne Sheh ke haath pakad kar basad buka <br>
Rakkhe chacha ke seene pe aur ro ke ye kaha <br>
Leeje yahi hai laash-e-Alamdaar-e-Bawafa <br>
Chillaye jhuk ke laash pe Sultan-e-Karbala <br>
<br>
<br>
Tooti hui kamar hai sambhaalo Hussain ko <br>
Bhaiyya zara gale se laga lo Hussain ko<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Abbas haath kat gaye shaanou se hai ghazab <br>
Reti pe do taraf hai tumhara lahu ye sab <br>
Loota hume Rasool ki ummat ne be sabab <br>
Bhaiyya humari jaan nikalti hai tan se ab <br>
<br>
<br>
Mar jaayenge, jila do hume mu se bol ke <br>
Do baate kar lo bhai se aankhou ko khol ke<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Ghash me suni jo girya-e-Shabbir ki sada <br>
Chauke tadap ke Hazrat-e-Abbas-e- Bawafa <br>
Aahista ki ye arz ke aye Sibte Mustafa <br>
Is pyaar ke nisaar, is ulfaat ke fida <br>
<br>
<br>
Zeba hai nikle jaan agar peshwaai ko <br>
Goya Rasool aaye hai Mushkil Kushaai ko<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Ye keh ke roye, Sheh ki taraf ki nazar baghaur <br>
Jhuk kar pukaare Shaah ke &ldquo;Bhaiyya kaho kuch aur&rdquo; <br>
Tadpa qadam pe Sheh ke wo maqtool-e-zulm o jaur <br>
Li hichkiya, bigadne lage tewarou ke taur <br>
<br>
<br>
Pathra ke chashm-e-ashk fishaa'n band ho gayi <br>
Tharraaye dono ho'nt, zabaa'n band ho gayi<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Akbar ne arz ki ke chacha jaan mar gaye <br>
Jhuk kar pukaare Shaah ke &ldquo;bhaiyya kidhar gaye&rdquo; <br>
Mu to uthaao khaak se rukhsaar bhar gaye <br>
Wa hasrataa, Hussain ko be aas kar gaye <br>
<br>
<br>
Ab kaun dega dukh me Nabi ke pisar ka saath <br>
Dum bhar me tum ne chhord diya umr bhar ka saath<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Haa'n ro lo momino ke buka ka maqaam hai <br>
Tum me shareek Rooh-e-Rasool-e-Anaam hai <br>
Ab rukhsat-e-Hussain Alaihis Salaam hai <br>
Tareekh aathwi hai, Moharram tamaam hai <br>
<br>
<br>
Maut aayi to shareek-e-aza kaun howega <br>
Jo saal bhar jiyega wo phir Sheh ko rowega<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Aage tumhaare marte jo Abbas-e-Bawafa <br>
Pursa na dete Sibte Rasool-e-Khuda ko kya <br>
Tum sab ko dekhte hai Shahinshaah-e-Karbala <br>
Zehra bhi nange sar hai, qayamat karo bapa <br>
<br>
<br>
Samjho shareek-e-bazm Shah-e-Mashraqain ko <br>
De lo jawaan bhai ka pursa Hussain ko<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Peeto sarou ko hota hai ab marsiya tamaam <br>
Lipto Zari-e-paak se keh keh ke &ldquo;Ya Imaam&rdquo; <br>
Rukhsat talab hai baap se Akbar sa Laalafaam <br>
Khamosh hai Hussain, nahi karte kuch kalaam <br>
<br>
<br>
Maqtool zulm o jaur hai ab ran me Fatima <br>
Hota hai Panjetan ka koi dum me khatima<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Bas aye Anees rok le ab khaama ki inaa'n <br>
Ye ghum hai jaa'n guzaa, na kabhi hoyega bayaa'n <br>
Aankhou se saamaeen ke bhi ashk hai rawaa'n <br>
Khaliq se arz kar ke aye Khallaq-e-Ins o Jaa'n <br>
<br>
<br>
Aankhou se mas karu mai Mazaar-e-Batool ko <br>
Dikhla de jald Marqad-e-Sibte Rasool ko<br>
